  "definition": "Function 4700: Debt Service",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-07-16",
  "historyNote": "#5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2206.09); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
